<title>POLAND: Polish unemployment falls to 11.7 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Polish unemployment falls to 11.7 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland fell to 11.7 percent of the workforce in May from 12.4 percent in April, figures from the Central Statistical Office (GUS) show.  </p>
<p> POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT	MAY 97	 APRIL 97    MAY 96</p>
<p> number of jobless million	2.04	  2.13	   2.57</p>
<p> pct of workforce	    11.7	  12.4	   14.7</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
